<details class="planning-debug-help">
    <summary>Debug workflow generation</summary>
    <p>Normal local startup opens a protected browser window with diagnostic planning and LLM trace inspection ready. If you opened this window separately, restart the local server and use the window it opens:</p>
    <pre><code>dotnet run --project src/GnOuGo.Agent.Server</code></pre>
    <p>New operator plans default to <strong>Diagnostic — thresholds are warnings</strong>; Strict remains selectable. Open <strong>Traces → Pipeline / LLM calls</strong> to inspect inputs and outputs. Financial limits and execution approval still apply. The Diagnostic launch profile remains available as an alias.</p>
</details>
